# tenant_migrations.manifest
#
# Byte-identical record of every TENANT_MIGRATIONS entry that has ever shipped.
# Format: <version>: <description>   (blank lines and # comments ignored)
#
# RULES (enforced by tenant_migrations_obey_append_only_manifest test):
#   1. Lines below this header are APPEND-ONLY. Never edit, never reorder,
#      never remove a line that has already shipped.
#   2. To add a new tenant migration: append a new (version, description)
#      line at the END here AND add the matching TenantMigration entry at the
#      end of TENANT_MIGRATIONS in tenant_migrations.rs. Both files must move
#      together in the same commit.
#   3. To change behavior for an already-published version, add a NEW
#      migration with the next higher version number; do NOT edit the old
#      entry. The runner records the version in schema_migrations; changing
#      a body for an already-applied version silently NO-OPs on every
#      existing deployment.
#
# History (2026-05-22, Patch 20): position v48 was reaffected at the
# VOCSAP merge of upstream commits d71342e (2026-05-05) and a0880ee
# (2026-05-13), moving "memories_community_id" to v51 and inserting
# "supervisor_injections_fix_schema" at v48. Tenants migrated before the
# merge were stuck on the old v48 body (memories_community_id) with
# schema_migrations.version >= 48, so the new v48 body never ran.
# v55 (supervisor_injections_repair) re-applies the missing ALTERs
# idempotently. This manifest is the safety net against recurrence.

